    "ev-81c0b161784a"
   ]
  },
  {
   "statement": "Gateway is not the origin. Its errors are relayed from orders 500s, according to both its own logs and the traces.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-208428dea34d",
    "ev-81c0b161784a"
   ]
  },
  {
   "statement": "A timeout cascade is unlikely for the failing requests, since the error traces complete in 3-31ms.",
   "evidence_ids": [
