   ]
  }
 ],
 "unknowns": [
  "No deployment records were found in the window, so it is unknown whether orders 2.7.0 or a database or config change was rolled out recently.",
  "There are no metrics or logs from the orders database itself. It is unknown whether the database is down, restarting, unreachable over the network, or at its connection limit.",
  "It is unknown whether all orders instances are affected or only some. The error ratio is partial (max 36.9%), which suggests a subset of instances, connections or hosts.",
  "The cause of the p95 latency increase to about 0.9s on gateway, orders and inventory is unexplained."
 ],
 "recommended_actions": [
  {
   "action": "Check the health of the orders database: whether it is up, its listener and port, network reachability from the orders pods, and its max connections.",
   "rationale": "The orders errors are 'database connection refused', and gateway fails because orders returns 500.",
   "evidence_ids": [
    "ev-7cd2f3a75ebc",
